  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AI for Development: Responsible AI, Empowering People (&#x2018;AI4D&#x2019;)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme will strengthen African AI ecosystems to develop and apply AI responsibly with investments across: 
&#x2022;	AI policy and governance research &#x2013; supporting Africa-based institutes to research the risks and governance challenges to inform national AI policies and regulation;
&#x2022;	AI talent and skills &#x2013; including interdisciplinary post-graduate AI research hubs at African universities;
&#x2022;	Machine-learning ready datasets &#x2013; improving access to datasets for AI models and applications;
&#x2022;	AI innovation &#x2013; supporting networks of African innovators to develop high-impact AI solutions to development challenges, exploring the untapped potential of Generative AI to create leapfrogging opportunities for Africa.
&#x2022;	Scaling AI impact &#x2013; catalysing financing to take the most promising innovations to scale.

All of the above activities will have a strong focus on responsible AI and on gender and inclusion.</narrative>
  </description>
